# Parsed caches, rebuilt on demand. solution/parse.py writes both:
#   solution/.cache/pk-<sha16>.parsed.pkl   keyed by pk.bin's own digest
#   solution/parsed.pkl                     fixed name, NOT keyed -- stale if pk.bin changes
